  TutorialText:
  - 
  - Press W A S D to Move.
  - 'You may encounter an Event. When you see the !, you can click anywhere to open
    the event. '
  - Some Events are required to progress the story.
  - The Tether is displayed above. It describes Yael and Jasper's frustration with
    each other.
  - View the map with the MAP button.
  - The strength of the Tether may change after mediation.
  - The strength of the Tether may change after mediation.
